name mleftright
category Package
revision 53021
shortdesc Variants of delimiters that act as maths open/close
longdesc The package defines variants \mleft and \mright of \left and
longdesc \right, that make the delimiters act as \mathopen and
longdesc \mathclose. These commands address spacing difficulties in
longdesc subformulas.
